find any info of weddings at this hotel....loads on Riu place RM but none for this! Stress! Anyone booked or had a wedding here since it has been refurbed? Do they provide the photographer? How many guests have to be attending to have a privet dinner? ( I really want a beach bbq buffet ) and last question ..... Did you hire in people to decorate the wedding or did the hotel provide it all? It is part of my package but wondering if they provide good decoration? Thank you in advance for any help! .... Any photos, tips ..... I&#039;d be very thankful Kat Xx","Attachments":[],"Id":1763844,"PostDate":1370258393,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Hoping for some tips\/advice. Booked our wedding through first choice\/thompsons for may 31st 2014 at Riu palace Mexico. I can't seem to find any info of weddings at this hotel....loads on Riu place RM but none for this! Stress! Anyone booked or had a wedding here since it has been refurbed? Do they provide the photographer? How many guests have to be attending to have a privet dinner? ( I really want a beach bbq buffet ) and last question ..... Did you hire in people to decorate the wedding or did the hotel provide it all? It is part of my package but wondering if they provide good decoration? Thank you in advance for any help! .... Any photos, tips ..... I'd be very thankful Kat Xx\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"o-xkatx@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363010062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267204.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kat2014","Id":267204,"Name":"kat2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74155,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a0bf230eb3192b28fe8c83d46e6245f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Kat,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Congrats on selecting the resort!! Tricky part is over :) We are currently planning a couple of weddings at the newly refurbished Riu Palace Mexico. No need to stress - just reach out to the hotel coordinator and they will be happy to&amp;nbsp;provide you with the anwsers you are looking for :) You have lots of time! Photography is not included in the packages, but you can hire their photographer (who is actually very good!!) - there information can be found at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsphoto.com\"&gt;www.adventureweddingsphoto.com&lt;\/a&gt;. The wedding package includes minimal decor for your ceremony, they will be able to help you with further decor you wish to purchase for your ceremony and\/or reception!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Happy Planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1763863,"PostDate":1370260545,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Kat,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congrats on selecting the resort!! Tricky part is over <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> We are currently planning a couple of weddings at the newly refurbished Riu Palace Mexico. No need to stress - just reach out to the hotel coordinator and they will be happy to\u00a0provide you with the anwsers you are looking for <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> You have lots of time! Photography is not included in the packages, but you can hire their photographer (who is actually very good!!) - there information can be found at <a href='http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsphoto.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.adventureweddingsphoto.com<\/a>. The wedding package includes minimal decor for your ceremony, they will be able to help you with further decor you wish to purchase for your ceremony and\/or reception!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laura@luxedestinationweddings.com ","IpAddress":"","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1304601090,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239674.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":145,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jessica4LUXE","Id":239674,"Name":"Jessica4LUXE","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74155,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e634d164c2fe2632ce8da323bb3efafa","RawContent":"Thank you so much, that&#039;s really helped :-) I think we have booked the royal package.... I just want the decor for the ceremony to look fab like some of the photos I&#039;ve seen for other places. Photographer is up there on the top of my list so I&#039;ll have a look at the link you have sent! Thank you! One last question haha .... I have requested 3pm for my ceremony, but now I&#039;m worrying it will still be too hot and thinking I should have asked for later.... What times do everyone normally go for? Thanks Kat","Attachments":[],"Id":1763880,"PostDate":1370263415,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you so much, that's really helped :-) I think we have booked the royal package.... I just want the decor for the ceremony to look fab like some of the photos I've seen for other places. Photographer is up there on the top of my list so I'll have a look at the link you have sent! Thank you! One last question haha .... I have requested 3pm for my ceremony, but now I'm worrying it will still be too hot and thinking I should have asked for later.... What times do everyone normally go for? Thanks Kat\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"o-xkatx@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363010062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267204.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kat2014","Id":267204,"Name":"kat2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74155,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50a122ff3f6df1157009d76a209dccac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Kat,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Welcome to the forum!!&amp;nbsp; If you need some advice regarding times and weather, check out our &lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"206612\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206612\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"204627\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/204627\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"189828\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189828\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"195032\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/195032\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1764499,"PostDate":1370378216,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Kat,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Welcome to the forum!!\u00a0 If you need some advice regarding times and weather, check out our <span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><u><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206612\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206612\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"204627\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/204627\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"189828\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189828\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"195032\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/195032\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori@sweetfirephotography.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1289175149,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233789.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SweetFire","Id":233789,"Name":"SweetFire","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74155,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa8c5df7203b176adcfb05c085296dfa","RawContent":"That&#039;s brilliant thank you I&#039;ve asked for a later time, just waiting for them to get back to me. Do you think I could have fireworks on the beach? Would my wedding planner organise that for me Xxx","Attachments":[],"Id":1764549,"PostDate":1370399074,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                That's brilliant thank you I've asked for a later time, just waiting for them to get back to me. Do you think I could have fireworks on the beach? Would my wedding planner organise that for me Xxx\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"o-xkatx@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363010062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267204.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kat2014","Id":267204,"Name":"kat2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74155,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1bddd7859afdaa83ab29d2d865730a4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Kat,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I imagine each hotel has it&#039;s own policy regarding fire works so your wedding planner would be the only person to be able to answer that!&amp;nbsp; Below is another idea for some fun at your wedding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sofia&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Lori&#039;s Office Assistant&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370559670466_1465\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"204156\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/204156\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1765379,"PostDate":1370541856,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Kat,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I imagine each hotel has it's own policy regarding fire works so your wedding planner would be the only person to be able to answer that!\u00a0 Below is another idea for some fun at your wedding.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sofia<\/p> <p> Lori's Office Assistant<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370559670466_1465\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"204156\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/204156\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori@sweetfirephotography.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1289175149,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233789.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SweetFire","Id":233789,"Name":"SweetFire","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74155,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec93f853aa33632d6a21fe3931898c84","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Kat2014,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Congratulations on getting your wedding plans off to a start. My Fiancee and I are getting Married next year at the Riu Caribe, i know its not the same hotel but maybe we can help each other with any questions that we may have?!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; With regards to your wedding plans, we have booked the same package for our wedding, due to the numbers we have going, the photographer isnt included in the package deal but hiring one will take a bit of research, we are in the middle of doing this just now and its quite hard to know what your looking for as all the photographers we have looked at, via the vendors on this site, all have really good looking portfolios!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also as part of the wedding package through Thomson\/First choice minimal decoration is included i.e. table cloth and seat covers etc but if you speak to your wedding co-ordinator they will be able to help you with your requests and anything else that you want to do with your special day.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Have you spoke to your wedding co-ordinator yet? Have you looked into the documentation requirements for your wedding?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Anyway i hope you&#039;re very excited and start to get things moving along.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Mark &amp;amp; Elaine.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1765523,"PostDate":1370598547,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Kat2014,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congratulations on getting your wedding plans off to a start. My Fiancee and I are getting Married next year at the Riu Caribe, i know its not the same hotel but maybe we can help each other with any questions that we may have?!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> With regards to your wedding plans, we have booked the same package for our wedding, due to the numbers we have going, the photographer isnt included in the package deal but hiring one will take a bit of research, we are in the middle of doing this just now and its quite hard to know what your looking for as all the photographers we have looked at, via the vendors on this site, all have really good looking portfolios!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also as part of the wedding package through Thomson\/First choice minimal decoration is included i.e. table cloth and seat covers etc but if you speak to your wedding co-ordinator they will be able to help you with your requests and anything else that you want to do with your special day.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Have you spoke to your wedding co-ordinator yet? Have you looked into the documentation requirements for your wedding?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Anyway i hope you're very excited and start to get things moving along.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Mark & Elaine.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"m_findlay@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"109.150.130.72","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358147475,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264399.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mark82","Id":264399,"Name":"mark82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74155,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6abdcec9171ba8c482d005970991db82","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Dear Kat&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Yes you can have ColdFireworks for more info:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; info@discomovilcancun.com&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370622927923_1267\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"203736\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/203736\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370622927923_1795\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"AppleMark \" data-id=\"203637\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/203637\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1765572,"PostDate":1370605140,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Dear Kat<\/p> <p> Yes you can have ColdFireworks for more info:<\/p> <p> info@discomovilcancun.com<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370622927923_1267\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"203736\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/203736\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370622927923_1795\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"AppleMark \" data-id=\"203637\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/203637\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"discomovil@msn.com","IpAddress":"189.149.58.121","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1204933254,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208750.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wedding Dj In Cancun","Id":208750,"Name":"Wedding Dj In Cancun","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74155,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bbdb6e6ea81de0e77b0e9f0e532c8a7a","RawContent":"Hi mark &amp; Elaine That sounds like a good idea I received my wedding co-ordinator details this week, I decided to change the time to 4pm rather than 3pm so the evening will flow smoothly .... I just sent her a email introducing myself and she changed the time for me - took 2 days to get back to me but I think it&#039;s down to them being busy. She told me about decoration coming at a separate price from the package and that she will speak to me closer to the time about it. I&#039;ve had a look at the documentation, from the pack I was given from first choice - very confusing. I&#039;m going to have a good read over it in the next few days. I asked about a privet dinner - I really want my reception on the beach ( fingers crossed for good weather ) and the fireworks look amazing! She said 30 + people to attend and there is an extra cost, but I may consider it. Have you spoken to your Wedding co-ordinator? Is it may your going? It will come round very fast!!!! Kat X","Attachments":[],"Id":1765828,"PostDate":1370660240,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi mark & Elaine That sounds like a good idea I received my wedding co-ordinator details this week, I decided to change the time to 4pm rather than 3pm so the evening will flow smoothly .... I just sent her a email introducing myself and she changed the time for me - took 2 days to get back to me but I think it's down to them being busy. She told me about decoration coming at a separate price from the package and that she will speak to me closer to the time about it. I've had a look at the documentation, from the pack I was given from first choice - very confusing. I'm going to have a good read over it in the next few days. I asked about a privet dinner - I really want my reception on the beach ( fingers crossed for good weather ) and the fireworks look amazing! She said 30 + people to attend and there is an extra cost, but I may consider it. Have you spoken to your Wedding co-ordinator? Is it may your going? It will come round very fast!!!! Kat X\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"o-xkatx@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363010062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267204.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kat2014","Id":267204,"Name":"kat2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74155,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5546a9c318666b42e00a6132d795827f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"SweetFire\"]\nHey Kat, I imagine each hotel has it&#039;s own policy regarding fire works so your wedding planner would be the only person to be able to answer that!  Below is another idea for some fun at your wedding.  Happy Planning! Sofia Lori&#039;s Office Assistant [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/204156\/\"]&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"204156\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"334\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/204156\/width\/500\/height\/1000\/flags\/LL\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/204156\/width\/500\/height\/1000\/flags\/LL\"[\/url] style=\"; width: 500px; height: 334px;\" width=\"500\"&gt; [\/url][\/quote] They look AMAZING, are they sparklers? Would I have to buy them in the uk and bring them over or could I get them over in Mexico? Thanks Kat","Attachments":[],"Id":1765829,"PostDate":1370660589,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"SweetFire\" url=\"\/t\/86443\/riu&#045;palace&#045;mexico&#045;brides&#045;2014#post_1913448\"><p>Hey Kat, I imagine each hotel has it's own policy regarding fire works so your wedding planner would be the only person to be able to answer that!\u00a0 Below is another idea for some fun at your wedding.\u00a0 Happy Planning! Sofia Lori's Office Assistant <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/204156\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"204156\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"334\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/204156\/width\/500\/height\/1000\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 500px; height: 334px;\" width=\"500\"><\/span> <\/a><\/p><\/blockquote> They look AMAZING, are they sparklers? Would I have to buy them in the uk and bring them over or could I get them over in Mexico? Thanks Kat\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"o-xkatx@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363010062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267204.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kat2014","Id":267204,"Name":"kat2014","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"74155","Title":"Riu palace Mexico brides 2014????? ","LastPostDate":1444725086},"Pages":{"TotalItems":43,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
