{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74155,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87c0e662e5be857b8364520a91cdb9dc","RawContent":"Hi Kat and welcome! I&#039;m getting married at the Riu Palace Mexico in less then three weeks (we leave 2 weeks from today!!)) and would be more then happy to answer any questions and pass along the info I&#039;ve received. I&#039;m on call this weekend and stuck at home so will put together some info for you in an email if that&#039;s ok with you, that way I can attach things like pics and prices that I&#039;ve been sent from the coordinator along the way. Please let me know if you have any specific questions and ill do my best to answer them. My best advice, don&#039;t sweat the small stuff Nd have fun planning! Karen","Attachments":[],"Id":1765861,"PostDate":1370683648,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Kat and welcome! I'm getting married at the Riu Palace Mexico in less then three weeks (we leave 2 weeks from today!!)) and would be more then happy to answer any questions and pass along the info I've received. I'm on call this weekend and stuck at home so will put together some info for you in an email if that's ok with you, that way I can attach things like pics and prices that I've been sent from the coordinator along the way. Please let me know if you have any specific questions and ill do my best to answer them. My best advice, don't sweat the small stuff Nd have fun planning! Karen\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karenmdelarda@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.118.20.67","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1342875139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258140.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kard613","Id":258140,"Name":"kard613","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74155,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ebf14ffb412baa0a644131badba3e453","RawContent":"Hi Karen Thank you that would be brilliant If you could! The hotel looks amazing! Bet you can&#039;t wait!!!!! Are all of your guests staying in your hotel? Only 90% of mine are....others are in the Yucatan next door. Have you decided where you are having your wedding reception? I really want the beach! My email is o-xkatx@hotmail.co.uk Send me anything you think will help :-D I&#039;d be very thankful! Kat X","Attachments":[],"Id":1765864,"PostDate":1370684381,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Karen Thank you that would be brilliant If you could! The hotel looks amazing! Bet you can't wait!!!!! Are all of your guests staying in your hotel? Only 90% of mine are....others are in the Yucatan next door. Have you decided where you are having your wedding reception? I really want the beach! My email is o-xkatx@hotmail.co.uk Send me anything you think will help :-D I'd be very thankful! Kat X\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"o-xkatx@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363010062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267204.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kat2014","Id":267204,"Name":"kat2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74155,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18612e8f980da0360daa9971f4a4aba9","RawContent":"Hi Kat, We&#039;ve contacted our wedding co-or donator a few times asking bits and bobs to do with wedding. We had to fill in a form with all our parents and witnesses information etc and we&#039;ve selected a restaurant for our wedding dinner. Te documentation side of things seems to be the only issue we&#039;ve had so far, getting a lot of different and contradicting information from everyone. Wedding co-ordinator says we need our birth certificates apostilled and translated into Spanish but thomson wedding specialists say we don&#039;t!! Very confusing!! Spoke to a woman on Friday that says we shouldn&#039;t need it but she will Contact the judge and find out which will be a lot of help!! We&#039;ve already got copies of our birth certificates and had them apostilled so would only need them to be translated. Would rather spend a little bit of money getting it done and have them rather than take the change not getting it done as panicking at the last Minute!! We&#039;ve started looking at photographers just now as well, trying to be as well prepared as possible!! Lol Anyway hope all is going well for you and your having a good weekend !! Mark &amp; Elaine","Attachments":[],"Id":1766124,"PostDate":1370781869,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Kat, We've contacted our wedding co-or donator a few times asking bits and bobs to do with wedding. We had to fill in a form with all our parents and witnesses information etc and we've selected a restaurant for our wedding dinner. Te documentation side of things seems to be the only issue we've had so far, getting a lot of different and contradicting information from everyone. Wedding co-ordinator says we need our birth certificates apostilled and translated into Spanish but thomson wedding specialists say we don't!! Very confusing!! Spoke to a woman on Friday that says we shouldn't need it but she will Contact the judge and find out which will be a lot of help!! We've already got copies of our birth certificates and had them apostilled so would only need them to be translated. Would rather spend a little bit of money getting it done and have them rather than take the change not getting it done as panicking at the last Minute!! We've started looking at photographers just now as well, trying to be as well prepared as possible!! Lol Anyway hope all is going well for you and your having a good weekend !! Mark & Elaine\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"m_findlay@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"109.150.130.72","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358147475,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264399.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mark82","Id":264399,"Name":"mark82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74155,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8ee22f580432bb3b8f328b844003bd2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kat2014\"]\nHi Karen Thank you that would be brilliant If you could! The hotel looks amazing! Bet you can&#039;t wait!!!!! Are all of your guests staying in your hotel? Only 90% of mine are....others are in the Yucatan next door. Have you decided where you are having your wedding reception? I really want the beach! My email is o-xkatx@hotmail.co.uk Send me anything you think will help :-D I&#039;d be very thankful! Kat X[\/quote] Hi Kat! I&#039;m also getting married at RPM in 2014 I just received my thomson\/firstchoice paper and date confirmation today! Could you email me any extras they may of sent u please Hun? Jadegibbs1989@hotmail.co.uk I&#039;m sooo excited maybe we can help each other plan ;) Jade","Attachments":[],"Id":1767907,"PostDate":1371125722,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"kat2014\" url=\"\/t\/86443\/riu&#045;palace&#045;mexico&#045;brides&#045;2014\/10#post_1913933\"><p>Hi Karen Thank you that would be brilliant If you could! The hotel looks amazing! Bet you can't wait!!!!! Are all of your guests staying in your hotel? Only 90% of mine are....others are in the Yucatan next door. Have you decided where you are having your wedding reception? I really want the beach! My email is o-xkatx@hotmail.co.uk Send me anything you think will help :-D I'd be very thankful! Kat X<\/p><\/blockquote> Hi Kat! I'm also getting married at RPM in 2014 I just received my thomson\/firstchoice paper and date confirmation today! Could you email me any extras they may of sent u please Hun? Jadegibbs1989@hotmail.co.uk I'm sooo excited maybe we can help each other plan <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> Jade\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadegibbs1989@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"188.39.68.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347120762,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260114.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Azulbride2014","Id":260114,"Name":"Azulbride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74155,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18a46eedf76af10634969ecc3fc00a89","RawContent":"Hi jade I&#039;ve emailed you Kat x","Attachments":[],"Id":1767989,"PostDate":1371135336,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\